  "title": "Design Capabilities Based on Reuse",
  "content_html": "<main class=\"p-page\">\n      <div class=\"l-container-fluid\">\n      <ul class=\"c-breadcrumb\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/BreadcrumbList\"><li class=\"c-breadcrumb__item\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><a itemprop=\"item\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp\"><span itemprop=\"name\" >HOME</span></a><meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"1\" /></li><li class=\"c-breadcrumb__item\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><a itemprop=\"item\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/why-choose-us/\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Reasons for Selection</span></a><meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"2\" /></li><li class=\"c-breadcrumb__item\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Design Capabilities Based on Reuse</span><meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"3\" /></li></ul>    </div>\n    <section class=\"p-page__header\">\n      <div class=\"l-container-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"p-page__title c-title-sec \">\n          <small class=\"p-page__parent-title p-page__title--fade\">Reasons for Selection</small>\n          <p class=\"c-text--en js-split\">\n            why choose us          </p>\n          <h1 class=\"c-text--ja p-page__title--fade\">Design Capabilities Based on Reuse</h1>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n                      <div class=\"p-page__thumbnail\">\n          <div class=\"u-media g-thumbnail\">\n            <img src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose.3.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n          </section>\n  \n\n  <div class=\"wp_block-content\">\n    \n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box alignwide is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box__header is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-decorated-top\">Reducing Environmental Impact with Reusable Materials</h2>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box__body is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In Japan, approximately 700 exhibitions are held annually, and many companies set up booths for just a few days of participation.<br>Conventional wooden booths are often dismantled and disposed of after the event, creating a significant burden both financially and environmentally.<br>Re:Booth (Re:ブース) achieves booth production with reduced waste by utilizing versatile materials such as display panels and display stands.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video p-section-video\"><video height=\"1080\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1920 / 1080;\" width=\"1920\" autoplay loop muted src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/rebooth-movie-01.mp4\" playsinline></video></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-1a05964e wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"960\" height=\"639\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/130953883-960x639.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-521\" srcset=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/130953883-960x639.jpeg 960w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/130953883-1920x1278.jpeg 1920w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/130953883-450x300.jpeg 450w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/130953883-768x511.jpeg 768w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/130953883-1536x1022.jpeg 1536w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/130953883-2048x1363.jpeg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Galvalume Steel Sheet</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/eco1-960x640.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-520\" srcset=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/eco1-960x640.jpg 960w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/eco1-450x300.jpg 450w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/eco1-768x512.jpg 768w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/eco1.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Increasing reusable materials to reduce waste volume</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading is-decorated-start\">Responsibility to Produce, Responsibility to Use</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The display panels are made of highly durable Galvalume steel and meet fire prevention standards.<br>By utilizing reusable materials, we promote environmentally conscious exhibition booth creation<strong>「</strong>Responsibility to Produce, Responsibility to Use<strong>」</strong>As part of our initiatives for [SDGs?], we will promote environmentally friendly exhibition booth construction.</p>\n    <div class=\"p-archive-list__link\">\n              <div class=\"p-page__list\">\n                      <a class=\"p-page__card\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/why-choose-us/design-quality/\">\n\n              <div class=\"p-page-card__header\">\n                <div class=\"p-page-card__thumbnail u-media\">\n                                                          <img src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose.2-450x253.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                  </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"p-page-card__body\">\n                <h3 class=\"p-page-card__title\">Uncompromising Design</h3>\n                <div class=\"p-page-card__excerpt\">\n                  Expanding Booth Expression with High Freedom Using a Truss Structure Re:Booth allows for flexible shapes by utilizing trusses for the framework, and can also accommodate hanging monitors. We accommodate various exhibition booth designs according to your requests while combining display panels and [&amp;hellip;]                </div>\n              </div>\n            </a>\n                      <a class=\"p-page__card\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/why-choose-us/reduces-costs/\">\n\n              <div class=\"p-page-card__header\">\n                <div class=\"p-page-card__thumbnail u-media\">\n                                                          <img src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/640788444-450x253.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                  </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"p-page-card__body\">\n                <h3 class=\"p-page-card__title\">Balancing Exhibition Costs and Environmental Impact</h3>\n                <div class=\"p-page-card__excerpt\">\n                  A System That Lowers Exhibition Costs the More You Use It Conventional exhibition booths often incur significant costs each time because design, drafting, and layout adjustments are all outsourced to contractors. Re:Booth not only reuses materials but also allows the design and layout [&amp;hellip;]                </div>\n              </div>\n            </a>\n          \n        </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n\n\n</main>",
